- # `↯/s.112.5` — `Sse.Error`
+ # `↯/s.112.5` — `Sse.Error`

- Raised when Obligatory cannot parse a server-sent event.
+ Sollevato quando Obligatory non riesce ad analizzare un server-sent event.

- ## Cause
+ ## Causa

- SSE messages are framed as `field: value` lines, with `field`
- restricted to `event`, `data`, `id`, or `retry`. The `SseSource`
- class also enforces a replay-buffer capacity. When any of these
- expectations is violated, this error is raised. The constructor
- takes a `reason: Reason`; the rendered message is `the
+ I messaggi SSE sono suddivisi in frame come righe `field: value`, con `field`
+ limitato a `event`, `data`, `id` o `retry`. La classe `SseSource`
+ impone inoltre una capacità al buffer di replay. Quando una qualsiasi di
+ queste aspettative viene violata, viene sollevato questo errore. Il costruttore
+ riceve un `reason: Reason`; il messaggio reso è `the

- server-sent event was not valid because $reason`.
+ server-sent event was not valid because $reason`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Varianti

- ### `↯/s.112.5.1` — `MalformedField`
+ ### `↯/s.112.5.1` — `MalformedField`

- A line in the SSE stream did not contain the required `:`
- separator between field name and value.
+ Una riga dello stream SSE non conteneva il separatore `:` richiesto
+ tra il nome del campo e il valore.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.112.5.1] the server-sent event was not valid because a line did not contain the expected field: value separator`
+ **Esempio.** `[↯/s.112.5.1] the server-sent event was not valid because a line did not contain the expected field: value separator`

- **Resolution.** Verify the producer is emitting valid SSE frames;
- each non-empty line must contain a colon.
+ **Soluzione.** Verificare che il producer emetta frame SSE validi;
+ ogni riga non vuota deve contenere i due punti.

- ### `↯/s.112.5.2` — `UnknownField`
+ ### `↯/s.112.5.2` — `UnknownField`

- A field name other than `event`, `data`, `id`, or `retry` was
- encountered.
+ È stato incontrato un nome di campo diverso da `event`, `data`, `id` o
+ `retry`.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.112.5.2] the server-sent event was not valid because the field name was not one of event, data, id, or retry`
+ **Esempio.** `[↯/s.112.5.2] the server-sent event was not valid because the field name was not one of event, data, id, or retry`

- **Resolution.** Strip non-standard fields before parsing; or extend
- the parser to accept the field.
+ **Soluzione.** Eliminare i campi non standard prima del parsing, oppure estendere
+ il parser in modo che accetti il campo.

- ### `↯/s.112.5.3` — `BadRetryValue`
+ ### `↯/s.112.5.3` — `BadRetryValue`

- The `retry` field's value was not a parseable integer.
+ Il valore del campo `retry` non era un intero analizzabile.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.112.5.3] the server-sent event was not valid because the retry field value could not be parsed as an integer`
+ **Esempio.** `[↯/s.112.5.3] the server-sent event was not valid because the retry field value could not be parsed as an integer`

- **Resolution.** The `retry` value must be a plain decimal integer
- (milliseconds).
+ **Soluzione.** Il valore di `retry` deve essere un semplice intero decimale
+ (in millisecondi).

- ### `↯/s.112.5.4` — `CapacityExceeded`
+ ### `↯/s.112.5.4` — `CapacityExceeded`

- The replay range requested from `SseSource.stream(start)` was
- larger than the source's circular buffer capacity, so older events
- have been overwritten.
+ L'intervallo di replay richiesto a `SseSource.stream(start)` era
+ più grande della capacità del buffer circolare della sorgente, quindi gli eventi
+ più vecchi sono stati sovrascritti.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.112.5.4] the server-sent event was not valid because the requested replay range exceeded the source buffer capacity`
+ **Esempio.** `[↯/s.112.5.4] the server-sent event was not valid because the requested replay range exceeded the source buffer capacity`

- **Resolution.** Increase the source's `capacity`, or request a more
- recent `start` index.
+ **Soluzione.** Aumentare la `capacity` della sorgente, o richiedere un indice `start`
+ più recente.

